// FAQ data
const faqs = [
  {
    question: 'What is the best portable charger for travel?',
    answer: '<p>The <strong>Anker 737 PowerCore</strong> is our top overall pick. With 24,000mAh capacity and 140W output, it can charge laptops, tablets, and phones multiple times. At $110, it\'s a solid investment for serious travelers.</p><p>For phone-only charging, the <strong>Anker 622 MagGo</strong> ($50) is perfect for iPhone users—compact, wireless, and attaches magnetically.</p><p>On a budget, the <strong>INIU 10000mAh</strong> ($20) offers excellent value for basic phone charging needs.</p>'
