    question: 'How many mAh do I need for travel?',
    answer: '<p>It depends on what you\'re charging:</p><ul><li><strong>5,000mAh:</strong> 1 full phone charge (emergency backup)</li><li><strong>10,000mAh:</strong> 2-3 phone charges (day trips)</li><li><strong>20,000mAh:</strong> 4-5 phone charges or tablets (multi-day travel)</li><li><strong>25,000+mAh:</strong> Laptops and multiple devices (serious nomads)</li></ul><p>For most digital nomads, <strong>20,000mAh</strong> hits the sweet spot—enough for a full day of heavy use without being too bulky.</p>'
