  {
    question: 'Can a portable charger charge a laptop?',
    answer: '<p><strong>Yes, but you need the right power bank.</strong> Key requirements:</p><ul><li><strong>USB-C PD (Power Delivery):</strong> Required for laptop charging</li><li><strong>Wattage:</strong> 45W minimum, 65W+ recommended</li><li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 20,000mAh+ for meaningful charge</li></ul><p>Our top laptop-charging picks:</p><ul><li><strong>Anker 737 (140W):</strong> Charges MacBook Pro at full speed</li><li><strong>Baseus 65W:</strong> Budget-friendly laptop charging</li><li><strong>Zendure SuperTank (100W):</strong> Maximum capacity option</li></ul><p><em>Note: Most laptops require 45-100W. Check your laptop\'s power requirements before buying.</em></p>'
