  <!-- Mophie Powerstation XXL -->
  <h3 id="mophie-xxl">5. Mophie Powerstation XXL — Best Reliability</h3>
  <p>
    Mophie has been making reliable power banks for years. The Powerstation XXL isn't the fastest or most
